<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Czech Open women's tennis tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>Marion Maruska (Austria) beat Catalina Cristea (Romania) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Joanette Kruger (South Africa) beat Veronika Martinek (Germany) 7-5 6-1.</p>
</text>
